    (MS (mkR x1 SP2 gp tp x5 t1 t2 sp a2 x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 a1 a0 ra x21 x22 x23 x24 x25 x26 x27 t3 t4 t5 t6)
        F (Z_to_bv 64 pc) fc None mm (seg_rom asegs)).
